<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">선발인원 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">약간 명</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">장학금 지원사항 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">가</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">학비면제 및 각종 비용 지원 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">나</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; ms