-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">가</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">다음 대학 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">(National University of Singapore, Nanyang Technological University, Singapore Management University, Singapore University of Technology and Design)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">에 지원한 자 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">각 대학의 입학조건은 해당 대학의 홈페이지 참고 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">나</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">학업성적이 우수하고</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">, co-curricular activities(CCA) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">활동 및 리더십을 갖춘 자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; FONT-SIZE